WEBVTT

00:05:57.667 --> 00:06:02.101
looked and saw not his fears reflected,

00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:03.518
not economic anxiety,

00:06:03.542 --> 00:06:06.518
not "what's going to happen to me
because things are changing."

00:06:06.542 --> 00:06:08.559
But looked and saw
a reflection of himself.

00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:11.559
He saw his neighbor,
he saw his common humanity.

00:06:11.583 --> 00:06:13.869
He didn't just see it,
he did something about it,

00:06:13.893 --> 00:06:15.143
my grandmother said.

00:06:15.167 --> 00:06:16.476
He got down on one knee,

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.434
he made sure the man was OK,

00:06:18.458 --> 00:06:21.393
and I heard, even gave him a room
at that nice Fairmont,

00:06:21.417 --> 00:06:22.976
the Pan Pacific one.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.750
(Laughter)

00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:28.768
And as I prepared to govern,

00:06:28.792 --> 00:06:31.768
I realized that given
the diversity of Stockton,